WEBVTT

00:01.800 --> 00:03.980
Boys' Conversation

00:06.940 --> 00:07.770
Wow!

00:09.100 --> 00:10.120
Huh? Wow!

00:11.600 --> 00:13.400
Oh wow!

00:14.740 --> 00:17.480
Wow! Wow! Wow!

00:18.350 --> 00:21.500
You can have a conversation made of "Wow!" only.

00:22.220 --> 00:24.500
Girls' Conversation 1

00:24.830 --> 00:25.770
Is it cute?

00:26.060 --> 00:27.370
Cute, right...

00:27.370 --> 00:28.850
Isn't it cute?

00:28.850 --> 00:30.000
Really cute!

00:30.000 --> 00:31.610
Wow, so cute!

00:31.610 --> 00:34.600
That's cute~

00:35.490 --> 00:38.660
You can have a conversation made of "Cute!" only.

00:39.450 --> 00:41.640
Girls' Conversation 2

00:42.340 --> 00:43.940
That's too bad, isn't it?

00:43.940 --> 00:45.020
Yeah, right.

00:45.020 --> 00:46.450
Right...

00:46.940 --> 00:48.230
Who are you talking about?

00:48.230 --> 00:48.910
Huh?

00:49.720 --> 00:51.990
What was her name again?

00:51.990 --> 00:52.660
From class four.

00:52.660 --> 00:53.740
Huh, not from two?

00:53.740 --> 00:54.420
Dunno.

00:54.420 --> 00:55.980
Huh?

00:56.050 --> 00:58.530
Still... Too bad, isn't it?

00:58.550 --> 01:02.040
You can have a conversation made of "Yeah" and "Right" only.

00:58.560 --> 01:00.120
Yeah, right...

01:00.120 --> 01:01.320
Right...

01:02.860 --> 01:05.040
Miu and Inaba 6

01:05.220 --> 01:08.340
Okay, then what type of boys do you like?

01:08.340 --> 01:13.630
Huh? Looks don't really matter, I'm more into kind people I guess.

01:15.560 --> 01:16.260
Oh,

01:17.200 --> 01:18.500
this is my treat.

01:18.500 --> 01:20.840
Thanks! You're so kind!

01:21.280 --> 01:22.560
Thank you.

01:23.960 --> 01:24.690
Here.

01:24.690 --> 01:26.660
I love this idol!

01:27.000 --> 01:28.690
What exactly do you like about him?

01:28.690 --> 01:29.880
His face.

01:29.880 --> 01:30.880
Eh...?

01:32.180 --> 01:34.320
Miu and Inaba 7

01:39.770 --> 01:41.450
Do your best!

01:41.450 --> 01:43.210
Fight!

01:43.210 --> 01:44.830
Go! Go!

01:55.490 --> 01:57.230
Senpai, you're amazing!

01:56.980 --> 01:58.340
Hey, Inaba-kun.

01:58.910 --> 02:00.100
Let's go home together.

02:00.100 --> 02:01.370
Huh? Yeah...

02:02.020 --> 02:04.540
That's rare, you don't propose to go together that often.

02:04.540 --> 02:06.490
That's not true~

02:06.970 --> 02:09.370
Guess she still likes me after all...

02:09.370 --> 02:10.900
I can't have him taken by other girls

02:12.720 --> 02:14.860
Sakura After Classes

02:15.030 --> 02:17.650
Love fortune-telling is so exiting.

02:17.650 --> 02:20.620
What if it says that the biggest popular period of my life comes soon?

02:20.620 --> 02:24.720
I'm already too popular, so that's gonna be a problem.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.620
The Death...

02:27.620 --> 02:30.790
You should stop all your inappropriate fantasies...

02:33.490 --> 02:34.510
Nah, that's wrong.

02:35.650 --> 02:37.320
The Fool...

02:37.320 --> 02:39.880
You're being arrogant.

02:39.880 --> 02:41.810
Nah, that's wrong.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.200
The Devil...

02:44.200 --> 02:47.140
Let's bring you back to your senses already.

02:49.850 --> 02:51.900
Omikuji fortune-telling is better after all!

02:53.900 --> 02:56.150
An Exemplary Woman♡Aoi Takizawa 2

02:53.900 --> 02:56.150
~Sports Day Compilation~

02:56.390 --> 02:57.940
Aoi-senpai, you're so cool!

02:57.940 --> 02:59.640
Can I take a picture?

02:59.640 --> 03:00.360
Sure.

03:00.930 --> 03:03.070
Aoi, you're so popular with the girls.

03:03.110 --> 03:04.210
So cute.

03:04.390 --> 03:06.110
Takezawa-senpai, you're cool!

03:06.110 --> 03:07.190
Can I take a picture?

03:07.190 --> 03:07.840
No.

03:08.280 --> 03:09.370
Huh...

03:09.370 --> 03:12.140
Aoi, you're so popular among boys too...

03:12.210 --> 03:13.740
Not a chance. Annoying.

03:14.820 --> 03:16.920
An Exemplary Man!! Daichi Ogasawara 2

03:25.620 --> 03:27.400
Senpai is really amazing!

03:27.400 --> 03:28.610
So cool!

03:29.110 --> 03:30.760
Doesn't it smell like sweat?

03:30.760 --> 03:32.840
No way I'm dating someone from the judo club.

03:34.780 --> 03:37.440
Judo club isn't popular, is it...

03:38.260 --> 03:40.430
An Exemplary Man!! Daichi Ogasawara 3

03:40.510 --> 03:43.080
One! Two!

03:43.080 --> 03:44.480
Do your best!

03:45.450 --> 03:47.290
Fight!

03:50.710 --> 03:52.220
Yeah, fight!

03:53.490 --> 03:55.800
Judo club isn't popular, is it...

03:57.300 --> 03:59.450
An Exemplary Man!! Daichi Ogasawara 4

04:03.720 --> 04:06.210
 Wow, amazing!

04:06.460 --> 04:09.920
Hey, Chi-chan, isn't that your older brother over there?

04:09.920 --> 04:10.970
Let's go.

04:10.970 --> 04:12.420
Eh? But...

04:12.420 --> 04:13.590
Just come on already.

04:13.590 --> 04:15.590
Judo club isn't popular, is it...

04:17.800 --> 04:19.980
Hidaka-sensei and Ryouko-sensei 1

04:21.860 --> 04:23.120
Oh, Ryouko-sensei!

04:24.060 --> 04:25.700
H-Hidaka-sensei?

04:25.700 --> 04:27.840
What a coincidence, I'm on my way home too.

04:27.840 --> 04:28.930
500 yen please.

04:28.930 --> 04:30.480
Ah, right.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.620
Um...

04:33.040 --> 04:34.250
This is, you see...

04:34.410 --> 04:35.470
Wedding?

04:35.470 --> 04:39.540
No, no, I don't have any plans or stuff like that!

04:39.570 --> 04:40.670
Goodbye!

04:41.230 --> 04:42.760
Hmm...

04:43.340 --> 04:45.560
Why did she turn so red?

04:45.560 --> 04:48.750
Could she possibly like me after all?

04:48.750 --> 04:49.820
Next customer, please.

04:50.960 --> 04:53.130
Hidaka-sensei and Ryouko-sensei 2

04:56.220 --> 04:57.140
Ryouko-sensei.

04:57.860 --> 04:59.330
Is that a picture of your student?

04:59.330 --> 05:04.210
Y-Yes, I just thought the geisha outfit looks very cute on her.

05:04.210 --> 05:07.160
So you're thinking of your students even during breaks?

05:07.840 --> 05:10.260
Aren't you a model teacher?

05:10.600 --> 05:11.910
N-No way...

05:12.500 --> 05:15.410
I'd rather say I'm a disgrace to the profession.

05:16.240 --> 05:19.420
Eh? Forget it! Goodbye!

05:20.370 --> 05:22.060
Hmm...

05:22.060 --> 05:25.480
I only praised her a little and she turned so red...

05:25.860 --> 05:28.960
Could she possibly like me after all?

05:30.490 --> 05:32.680
Hidaka-sensei and Ryouko-sensei 3

05:34.750 --> 05:36.350
Ah, Ryouko-sensei.

05:36.350 --> 05:38.330
Hidaka-sensei!

05:39.620 --> 05:41.060
Is that alcohol?

05:41.540 --> 05:46.720
Yes, recently I've feel like drinking alone quite often.

05:46.720 --> 05:47.530
Alone?

05:48.090 --> 05:51.980
Ah, but it's not that I'm lonely or anything like that!

05:51.980 --> 05:53.570
See you.

05:55.200 --> 05:56.610
Hmm.....

05:56.610 --> 05:59.450
Specifically telling me that you're drinking alone...

05:59.450 --> 06:03.000
Ryouko really does like me!

06:03.560 --> 06:06.010
Why is he grinning like that? Gross.

06:06.820 --> 06:08.970
Sakura's Delusions Diary

06:10.240 --> 06:11.470
Excuse me.

06:11.690 --> 06:16.930
Aren't there women like this,
who hesitate to say what they want to?

06:18.400 --> 06:23.230
I can see through women though.

06:23.640 --> 06:26.580
Like "she's thinking about this right now."

06:28.220 --> 06:30.360
See through women?!

06:30.790 --> 06:37.140
He says he knows what I'm thinking about?
What's the appeal of that?

06:37.470 --> 06:43.720
Is he trying to approach me pretending to be an understanding teacher?!

06:43.720 --> 06:46.130
That's definitely it!

06:46.130 --> 06:51.450
Recently one student of mine, you see, she came asking for advice.

06:50.260 --> 06:52.420
Still, Hidaka is no good.

06:53.950 --> 06:56.140
Miu, the Strongest Girl

06:56.140 --> 06:57.850
Hey, are you high schoolers?

06:57.850 --> 06:59.640
Come play with us!

07:00.710 --> 07:05.700
But we're school girls and don't have any money.

07:06.630 --> 07:07.840
That's fine!

07:07.840 --> 07:12.240
Oh, really? I want to go to karaoke!

07:12.530 --> 07:15.530
Yay, Miu, you're good!

07:15.850 --> 07:17.310
Not really.

07:17.560 --> 07:21.800
Now I want to drink. Can we order some more juice?

07:21.800 --> 07:22.960
No problem!

07:23.230 --> 07:27.360
Also fried chicken, fries, and rare cheesecake as well.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.050
Eh?

07:28.050 --> 07:30.050
Pretty please!

07:30.050 --> 07:32.050
Sure!

07:32.350 --> 07:34.050
Whoah, it's late already!

07:34.050 --> 07:36.880
Sorry, we have a curfew, so we'll be heading home now.

07:37.750 --> 07:39.780
And your contact info?

07:39.780 --> 07:43.200
Ah! Here's my LINE address. Let's have fun again!

07:44.840 --> 07:46.170
Was that okay, Miu?

07:46.170 --> 07:47.850
Telling them your LINE?

07:47.850 --> 07:51.660
Ah, that's a fake account for times like this, so no problems at all.

07:51.950 --> 07:54.990
I'm stuffed! It was fun!

07:54.990 --> 07:59.080
Miu, you're amazing! I learned a lot.

07:59.940 --> 08:02.080
~Christmas Compilation~

07:59.940 --> 08:02.080
An Exemplary Man!! Daichi Ogasawara 5

08:02.100 --> 08:04.360
Merry Christmas!

08:05.650 --> 08:08.280
Ha ha, this party is the best ever!

08:08.280 --> 08:09.670
Yay!

08:11.610 --> 08:13.810
Christmas is the time for dates.

08:13.810 --> 08:15.760
Look, that accessory is cute!

08:15.760 --> 08:19.340
Yo! Merry Christmas!

08:19.340 --> 08:21.300
The chicken is superb!

08:21.300 --> 08:23.350
Judo club isn't popular, is it...

08:25.170 --> 08:27.400
Setsuko and Nagahara 5

08:25.170 --> 08:27.400
~Christmas Compilation~

08:29.980 --> 08:30.920
What's wrong?

08:30.920 --> 08:33.680
Nagahara sent a message...

08:33.900 --> 08:35.140
Ryouko, Merry Christmas!

08:35.140 --> 08:35.890
Ryouko, Merry Christmas!

08:39.180 --> 08:41.930
This is my present for you - a love song!

08:39.390 --> 08:40.890
Huh? A video?

08:41.910 --> 08:46.420
Yo yo! I've known love! I've cut my hair! Oh yeah!

08:45.000 --> 08:46.420
What's this?

08:46.420 --> 08:48.380
What's that? Something bad?

08:48.380 --> 08:50.200
No, it's a secret.

08:52.030 --> 08:54.020
Yesterday, I had a fight with Setsuko...

08:54.430 --> 08:56.200
Huh, for real?

08:56.200 --> 08:59.970
It came down to a quarrel, but I raised my voice and talked her down.

08:59.970 --> 09:01.510
Isn't she angry?

09:01.510 --> 09:02.940
Nothing serious.

09:03.630 --> 09:05.580
A message...

09:05.580 --> 09:06.430
Me too.

09:07.200 --> 09:08.780
Huh, what's this?

09:09.230 --> 09:13.710
Yo yo! I've known love! I've cut my hair! Oh yeah!

09:13.710 --> 09:19.200
I love you, Setsuko. I need you, let's go. Merry Christmas.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.250
Crap...

09:21.250 --> 09:23.200
She's spreading it...

09:23.560 --> 09:24.970
Huh? What?

09:25.770 --> 09:27.710
Women are scary!

09:28.570 --> 09:30.710
Ayane's Boyfriend 3

09:31.430 --> 09:34.950
Please eat to your heart's content!

09:34.970 --> 09:37.140
Thank you!

09:37.140 --> 09:39.660
Come on, why are you so tense?

09:39.660 --> 09:42.710
Well, I can't just ease up.

09:45.400 --> 09:47.250
Listen, Kasai-kun...

09:47.250 --> 09:47.880
What?

09:48.140 --> 09:52.270
Aren't you showing off a bit too much with your bleached hair?

09:52.270 --> 09:53.790
Oh, thank you...

09:53.790 --> 09:55.610
That's not true!

09:55.610 --> 09:59.760
That's completely normal these days! Besides, it looks stylish and cool.

09:59.760 --> 10:00.970
Thank you!

10:00.970 --> 10:02.040
Good for you!

10:05.440 --> 10:07.830
Come on, drink a little!

10:07.830 --> 10:10.260
Sorry, I came by car...

10:10.260 --> 10:11.790
Dad, stop it.

10:11.790 --> 10:15.350
Hmpf, the youth these days...

10:19.040 --> 10:19.890
I'll lend a hand.

10:19.890 --> 10:23.090
Thank you so much!

10:23.090 --> 10:26.410
Dad hasn't even helped me once...

10:26.710 --> 10:29.630
All he does is drink by himself, which isn't helpful.

10:36.650 --> 10:39.230
Sorry that my husband is so lazy...

10:39.230 --> 10:40.910
No, no, no.

10:41.300 --> 10:44.630
I don't have anyone except my old man, so I was kinda happy.

10:44.630 --> 10:45.890
Really?

10:46.780 --> 10:50.000
I'm always talking to Ayane-san about the future.

10:50.730 --> 10:53.010
I'm still only studying, but...

10:53.010 --> 10:58.870
Someday I want to make a bright and cheerful family just like yours.

10:59.930 --> 11:04.250
Oh, what are you saying! What will my husband say if he hears this?

11:04.250 --> 11:05.450
And how many kids?

11:06.420 --> 11:08.000
He's such a good guy.

11:10.580 --> 11:12.690
Kotarou's Parents 2

11:14.940 --> 11:16.780
They're so good!

11:17.110 --> 11:18.920
What exactly about them is good?

11:19.420 --> 11:24.760
That's a Korean-like idol group. They're so manly and lovely!

11:35.400 --> 11:37.460
Kotarou's Parents 3

11:41.990 --> 11:43.640
He's so good!

11:43.640 --> 11:45.050
What exactly about him is good?

11:45.630 --> 11:51.300
That's a popular martial artist. He's so manly and lovely!

12:03.440 --> 12:05.700
Kotarou's Parents 4

12:09.280 --> 12:10.630
It's so good!

12:10.960 --> 12:13.450
What exactly about it is good?

12:13.730 --> 12:17.950
That's a popular mascot character. Surprisingly cute, isn't it?

12:34.870 --> 12:36.980
An Exemplary Woman♡Aoi Takizawa 3

12:34.870 --> 12:36.980
~Valentine's Day Compilation~

12:40.230 --> 12:41.310
Did you see that?

12:41.310 --> 12:44.820
Yeah, I did! Aoi-senpai is holding such a cute bag!

12:44.820 --> 12:46.740
There must be chocolate inside!

12:47.170 --> 12:49.520
Who is she gonna give it to?

12:49.990 --> 12:52.010
Hey, let's eat together!

12:52.250 --> 12:53.750
What's that?

12:53.960 --> 12:55.760
I got it from a female kouhai.

12:55.760 --> 12:57.330
Aoi-senpai, take mine too...

12:57.330 --> 12:58.870
Please take it!

12:58.870 --> 13:00.310
Whoah, thanks!

13:00.310 --> 13:02.700
You're as popular as usual.

13:03.960 --> 13:06.010
Aira and Kaneko 3

13:03.960 --> 13:06.010
~Valeintine Day Compilation~

13:10.260 --> 13:11.400
Wanna eat it?

13:11.950 --> 13:12.560
Not really.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.980
Then I'm not giving it to you.

13:15.260 --> 13:17.190
Fine, I have some anyway.

13:18.300 --> 13:19.260
Wait!

13:20.610 --> 13:21.610
This one is enough.

13:24.990 --> 13:27.160
Ryouko-sensei and Roman

13:24.990 --> 13:27.160
~Valentine's Day Compilation~

13:28.470 --> 13:29.970
I brought it...

13:31.270 --> 13:34.170
No way! A teacher can't give it to a student!

13:34.170 --> 13:37.070
Ryouko-sensei! Here, take it.

13:38.890 --> 13:40.490
Thanks for everything, Sensei.

13:45.030 --> 13:45.830
Here you go.

13:46.100 --> 13:46.930
Thanks.

13:47.360 --> 13:48.990
Thanks for everything, Daichi.

13:48.990 --> 13:50.670
Only from you again...

13:57.350 --> 13:59.760
Obligation chocolate is fine too...

14:01.590 --> 14:03.690
Setsuko and Nagahara 5

14:01.590 --> 14:03.690
~Valentine's Day Compilation~

14:03.950 --> 14:06.450
Come on, Setsuko, give me some chocolate.

14:06.450 --> 14:09.320
Nope, you got a lot from other girls.

14:09.320 --> 14:14.480
What's wrong with that? Come on, I want yours too...

14:14.480 --> 14:16.030
Setsuko, chocolate, chocolate!

14:16.030 --> 14:17.420
You're annoying!

14:17.730 --> 14:19.710
Here, leftovers from friendship chocolate.

14:19.940 --> 14:23.210
Whoah, for real? I'm so happy.

14:25.470 --> 14:27.800
Come on, let's go! Will you?

14:27.800 --> 14:31.720
Ah? Uh... Yeah.

14:32.940 --> 14:35.620
Sorry, I got no money.

14:35.620 --> 14:37.320
Today, I'll pay...

14:38.670 --> 14:40.840
Miu and Inaba 8

14:38.670 --> 14:40.840
~Valentine's Day Compilation~

14:41.920 --> 14:42.690
Chocolate?

14:42.690 --> 14:43.360
Yes.

14:43.360 --> 14:45.110
I handed it out to everyone.

14:45.110 --> 14:46.960
Ah, so it's friendship chocolate?

14:46.960 --> 14:47.990
Where's mine?

14:47.990 --> 14:48.740
Don't have any.

14:48.740 --> 14:49.490
Eh?!

14:49.490 --> 14:51.490
Well, you aren't a friend after all.

14:51.490 --> 14:52.900
Ah...

14:52.900 --> 14:54.120
So it's love chocolate?

14:54.480 --> 14:55.850
Not a boyfriend either though.

14:56.420 --> 14:58.810
Kaneko-kun, friendship chocolate for you!

15:00.530 --> 15:02.630
Sakura and Valentine's Day

15:02.630 --> 15:07.680
Valentine's day...
This year's sinful season has come at last...

15:08.130 --> 15:12.310
All the boys in this class are probably thinking they may get chocolate from me...

15:12.310 --> 15:14.590
They're definitely expecting it!

15:15.110 --> 15:21.150
They're always fighting for me, but this time, everyone just keeps waiting quietly...

15:21.150 --> 15:25.550
Ha ha, come on, I don't have the money for that.
